cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "alignmap: mapping the AI-alignment literature across venues"
abstract: >-
  Clusters alignment-research writing from several venues and tests, with uncertainty and with
  adjustment for the mix of venues, which subfields gained or lost share between two periods.
  Includes a method comparison scored against community topic tags.
version: 0.2.0
license: MIT
